<title>USA: Costco January same-store sales up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Costco January same-store sales up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISSAQUAH, Wash 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>				1996	 1995	     Total</p>
<p>Same-Store Month	     $1,460    $1,300	  +12		 +10</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $9,180    $8,250	  +11		  +9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is  four  weeks ended Feb 2.</p>
<p>Year-to-date is first 22 weeks of 1997 fiscal year ended Feb. 2.</p>
<p>Company changed name from PriceCostco Inc to Costco Cos Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
